      "id": "sol.amc-8-2017-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The denominator is \\(1+2+\\cdots+8=36=2\\cdot3\\cdot6.\\) Canceling those three factors from the numerator leaves \\(4\\cdot5\\cdot7\\cdot8=1120.\\)\n\nThus, B is the correct answer.",
